sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户(React)
    participant API as /api/v1/topics/recommend
    participant TS as TopicRecommendService
    participant DM as DataManager
    participant TC as TopicChain
    participant LLM as LLMClient
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Chr as ChromaDB

    U->>API: POST /topics/recommend {mode: "hotspot_fusion"}
    API->>API: JWT验证 + 速率限制检查(20/天)
    API->>TS: recommend(user_id, mode)
    TS->>DB: 查询CreatorProfile + rubric_weights
    DB-->>TS: 返回画像数据
    TS->>DM: get_trending_topics(track) + get_hot_topics()
    DM->>DM: 降级链: TianAPI→B站→LLM模拟→预置
    DM-->>TS: 返回趋势数据(data_source标注)
    TS->>TC: 构建TopicChain(画像+数据上下文+Prompt版本)
    TC->>LLM: DeepSeek V4 Flash(结构化输出)
    LLM-->>TC: 返回10个候选选题(JSON)
    TC-->>TS: Pydantic解析为TopicItem列表
    TS->>TS: _filter_by_track() 赛道过滤
    TS->>TS: _filter_by_format() 创作方式过滤
    TS->>TS: _filter_by_data_quality() 数据质量过滤
    TS->>TS: _rank_topics(rubric_weights) 综合排序
    TS->>Chr: 爆款相似度检索(去重)
    Chr-->>TS: 相似度分数
    TS->>TS: _apply_feedback_weights(历史反馈)
    TS->>DB: 保存推荐结果
    TS-->>API: 返回TOP5选题 + AIQualityMeta
    API-->>U: {code:200, data:{topics[], meta:{ai_quality}}}
